          <sense n="3"><hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:durch"><abbr>durch</abbr></ref> Wirken von;</hi> ~ hine (<hi rend="italic">selbst, persönlich</hi>) oððe ~ feormunge [<hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sieheNummer"><abbr>s. n.</abbr></ref></hi> 4] <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 4; ~ þone <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IudDeiIV">Iud Dei IV</ref> 3, per quem (facta sunt omnia) <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:glossirend"><abbr>glossirend</abbr></ref>;</hi> ~ bydelas <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 1,2</sense>
